{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03008","headline":"夏日奉使南海在道中作 · 张九龄","name":"夏日奉使南海在道中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缅然万里露，赫曦三伏时。\n飞走逃深林，流烁恐生疵。\n行李岂无苦，而我方自怡。\n肃事诚在公，拜庆遂及私。\n展力慙浅效，衔恩感深慈。\n且欲汤火蹈，况无鬼神欺。\n朝发高山阿，夕济长江湄。\n秋瘴宁我毒，夏水胡不夷。\n信知道存者，但问心所之。\n吕梁有出入，乃觉非虚词。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}